        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AF-B7, Paddle Lever with Oval Beaded Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oval Beaded Rose of this leverset adds just enough detailing to the Paddle Lever to make it an excellent choice for anyone with more traditional tastes. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, brushed nickel, and antique pewter finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AF-B7 Paddle Lever and Oval Beaded Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Traditional Door Lever Fusion AF B7:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Paddle Lever With Oval Beaded Rose, Fusion AF-B7",
                "description": "Traditional Brass Paddle Lever with Oval Beaded Rose Fusion AF-B7 - The Oval Beaded Rose of this leverset adds just enough detailing to the Paddle Lever to make it an excellent choice for anyone with more traditional tastes. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, brushed nickel, and antique pewter finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n",
